# Production build config (Vite reads this automatically on `vite build`).
#
# >>> REPLACE the host below with YOUR deployed Express backend URL, then
#     rebuild + redeploy on Netlify. Keep the trailing "/api". <<<
#
# This must be the EXPRESS service (Node) — it proxies your FastAPI ML engine at
# https://atmosiq-1-y8f8.onrender.com. Point Express's own ML_ENGINE_URL env var
# at that FastAPI URL when you deploy it.
#
# Alternatively (recommended for secrets-free repos): leave this as-is and set
# VITE_API_BASE in Netlify → Site settings → Environment variables instead — a
# value set there overrides this file at build time.
VITE_API_BASE=https://REPLACE-WITH-YOUR-EXPRESS-BACKEND.onrender.com/api
